  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oPt CAP 2010 Diakonia IHL</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">oPt CAP 2010 Diakonia IHL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra efterlevnaden av internationell humanit&#xE4;r r&#xE4;tt (IHL) i den israelisk-palestinska konflikten. Insatsen arbetar med informationsspridning och st&#xF6;d till lokala organisationer som verkar inom IHL. Insatsen &#xE4;mnar skydda m&#xE4;nniskor i utsatta situationer d&#xE4;r det finns risk f&#xF6;r brott mot IHL.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective is to decrease violations of HR and IHL in Palestine and Israel when providing protection through preventative presence and accompaniment in communities and areas where people are vulnerable to violation of these rights.Espected results is to promote and respect IHL within the project target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
